# Elegance Patterns for CentaurOS UI

These patterns establish visual elegance, polish, and consistency across all CentaurOS pages.

**Applied to:** Team page, Objectives page, Tasks page

## 1. Card & Container Patterns

### Standard Card
All cards should use rounded-xl with subtle shadows and borders:

```tsx
// ✅ CORRECT - Elegant card
<Card className="rounded-xl border shadow-sm">
  <CardHeader>...</CardHeader>
  <CardContent>...</CardContent>
</Card>

// ❌ WRONG - Basic or harsh styling
<Card className="border">...</Card>
<Card className="rounded-lg shadow-md">...</Card>
```

### Interactive Cards (hover effects)
Cards that users interact with need smooth transitions:

```tsx
// ✅ CORRECT - Smooth hover with lift effect
<div className={`
  bg-card rounded-xl border shadow-sm
  transition-all duration-200 ease-out
  hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-0.5
  active:translate-y-0 active:shadow-md active:scale-[0.99]
`}>

// ❌ WRONG - No transition or harsh effect
<div className="bg-card rounded-lg hover:shadow-xl">
```

**Key properties:**
- `duration-200 ease-out` - Smooth, natural feel
- `hover:-translate-y-0.5` or `hover:-translate-y-1` - Subtle lift
- `active:scale-[0.99]` - Click feedback
- `hover:shadow-lg` - Elevated appearance on hover

## 2. Section Headers with Accent Bars

All section headers should have colored accent bars that match the content theme:

```tsx
// ✅ CORRECT - Section header with accent bar
<h2 className="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground border-b border-muted pb-3 flex items-center gap-3">
  <div className="w-1 h-6 bg-international-orange rounded-full" />
  Founders
  <span className="text-sm font-normal text-muted-foreground">Decision makers</span>
</h2>

// ❌ WRONG - Colored text header
<h2 className="text-xl font-semibold text-purple-600 uppercase tracking-wider">
  Founders (Decide)
</h2>
```

**Accent bar colors by role/type:**
| Content Type | Accent Color |
|---|----|
| Founders/Leadership | `bg-international-orange` |
| Executives | `bg-orange-400` |
| Apprentices | `bg-slate-400` |
| AI Agents | `bg-violet-500` |
| Teams/Groups | `bg-muted-foreground` |
| Generic sections | `bg-muted-foreground` |

## 3. Empty States

Empty states should be welcoming, not harsh:

```tsx
// ✅ CORRECT - Soft, centered empty state
<div className="flex flex-col items-center justify-center py-12 text-center bg-muted/30 rounded-xl">
  <div className="p-4 rounded-full bg-muted mb-4">
    <Users className="h-10 w-10 text-muted-foreground" />
  </div>
  <p className="text-muted-foreground">No members yet</p>
</div>

// ❌ WRONG - Harsh dashed border
<div className="border-2 border-dashed border-muted rounded-lg p-8">
  <p className="text-center text-muted-foreground">No data</p>
</div>
```

**Key properties:**
- `bg-muted/20` or `bg-muted/30` - Soft background
- `rounded-xl` - Soft corners
- Large icon (`h-10 w-10`) in a rounded container
- Centered layout with generous padding (`py-12`)

## 4. View Mode Toggles

Toggle buttons should use brand colors for active state:

```tsx
// ✅ CORRECT - Brand-colored active state
<Button
  className={cn(
    "h-8 w-8 p-0 rounded-md transition-all duration-200",
    viewMode === 'grid' 
      ? 'bg-international-orange/10 text-international-orange shadow-sm' 
      : 'text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground hover:bg-muted'
  )}
>
  <LayoutGrid className="h-4 w-4" />
</Button>

// ❌ WRONG - Plain white active state
<Button className={viewMode === 'grid' ? 'bg-background shadow-sm' : ''}>
```

## 5. List Row Hover States

List/table rows should have soft hover transitions:

```tsx
// ✅ CORRECT - Soft hover with transition
<tr className="group hover:bg-muted/50 active:bg-muted transition-colors duration-150">

// ❌ WRONG - Harsh or no transition
<tr className="hover:bg-muted">
```

## 6. Icon Containers

Icons in headers or cards should have background containers:

```tsx
// ✅ CORRECT - Icon with branded background
<div className="h-10 w-10 rounded-xl bg-international-orange/10 flex items-center justify-center">
  <Target className="h-5 w-5 text-international-orange" />
</div>

// ❌ WRONG - Raw icon or wrong container
<div className="h-10 w-10 rounded-lg bg-status-warning-light">
  <Target className="h-5 w-5 text-status-warning" />
</div>
```

**Icon container patterns:**
- `rounded-xl` for larger icons (10x10 and up)
- `rounded-lg` for smaller icons (6x6 to 8x8)
- Use `/10` opacity of the brand color for background

## 7. Drag & Drop Feedback

Drag and drop should have clear, animated feedback:

```tsx
// ✅ CORRECT - Enhanced drag feedback
// Dragging item
${isDragging ? 'opacity-50 scale-95 shadow-xl rotate-2' : ''}

// Drop target
${isDropTarget ? 'ring-2 ring-status-success border-status-success bg-status-success-light scale-[1.02]' : ''}

// Drop overlay
<div className="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center bg-status-success-light/80 backdrop-blur-[2px] rounded-lg z-10 animate-in fade-in duration-200">
  <div className="bg-status-success text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-medium flex items-center gap-2 shadow-lg animate-in zoom-in-95 duration-200">
    <Zap className="h-4 w-4 fill-white animate-pulse" />
    Drop to pair
  </div>
</div>
```

## 8. Loading Skeletons

Loading skeletons should match the layout they're replacing:

```tsx
// ✅ CORRECT - Matching skeleton with accent
<div className="flex items-center gap-3">
  <div className="w-1 h-8 bg-international-orange/30 rounded-full" />
  <Skeleton className="h-8 w-48" />
</div>

// ❌ WRONG - Generic skeleton
<Skeleton className="h-8 w-48" />
```

**Skeleton best practices:**
- Include colored accent bars matching the content
- Match the exact layout structure
- Use appropriate corner radius (`rounded-md`, `rounded-xl`)
- Include all visual elements (icons, badges, etc.)

## 9. Select All / Bulk Action Headers

Bulk action controls should be subtle but discoverable:

```tsx
// ✅ CORRECT - Soft container
<div className="flex items-center px-4 py-3 bg-muted/30 rounded-xl border border-muted">
  <input type="checkbox" />
  <span className="text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground">Select All</span>
</div>

// ❌ WRONG - Harsh styling
<div className="flex items-center px-4 py-2 bg-muted/50 rounded-md">
```

## 10. Content Expansion (Collapsible)

Expanded content areas should have subtle differentiation:

```tsx
// ✅ CORRECT - Soft expanded area
<div className="bg-muted/20 border-t border-muted">
  {/* Expanded content */}
</div>

// ❌ WRONG - Harsh or same background
<div className="bg-muted/30">
```

## 11. Selection States

Selected items should use brand colors:

```tsx
// ✅ CORRECT - Brand-colored selection ring
<Card className={cn(
  "rounded-xl border shadow-sm",
  isSelected && "ring-2 ring-international-orange/50 bg-international-orange/5 border-international-orange/30"
)}>

// ❌ WRONG - Blue or generic selection
<Card className={cn(
  "border",
  isSelected && "ring-2 ring-electric-blue bg-electric-blue-light/10"
)}>
```

**Selection row highlight:**
```tsx
// ✅ CORRECT - Subtle row selection
<tr className={cn(
  "hover:bg-muted/50 transition-colors duration-150",
  isSelected && "bg-international-orange/5 hover:bg-international-orange/10"
)}>
```

## 12. Chart Cards

Analytics chart cards should have consistent styling:

```tsx
// ✅ CORRECT - Chart card with icon container
<Card className="rounded-xl border shadow-sm">
  <CardHeader className="pb-2">
    <CardTitle className="text-sm font-medium flex items-center gap-2">
      <div className="p-1.5 rounded-lg bg-muted/50">
        <ChartIcon className="h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground" />
      </div>
      Chart Title
    </CardTitle>
  </CardHeader>
</Card>

// ❌ WRONG - Plain icon without container
<Card className="border">
  <CardTitle className="flex items-center gap-2">
    <ChartIcon className="h-4 w-4" />
    Chart Title
  </CardTitle>
</Card>
```

## 13. Warning/Attention Sections

Sections requiring user attention should use warning styling:

```tsx
// ✅ CORRECT - Warning-styled attention section
<div className="rounded-xl border border-status-warning/30 shadow-sm overflow-hidden bg-status-warning-light/30">
  <div className="bg-status-warning-light/50 px-4 py-3 border-b border-status-warning/20 cursor-pointer hover:bg-status-warning-light/70 transition-colors duration-150">
    <h3 className="font-semibold text-status-warning-dark flex items-center gap-3">
      <AlertTriangle className="h-4 w-4 text-status-warning" />
      <span>Tasks Without Objective ({count})</span>
      <span className="text-xs font-normal text-status-warning ml-auto">Assign to an objective</span>
    </h3>
  </div>
</div>

// ❌ WRONG - Generic muted section for attention items
<div className="rounded-xl border bg-background">
  <div className="bg-muted/50 px-4 py-3">
    General Tasks (No Objective)
  </div>
</div>
```

## 14. Quick Add / Input Triggers

Expandable input triggers should be inviting:

```tsx
// ✅ CORRECT - Soft, inviting trigger
<button className="w-full flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-3.5 
  text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground 
  border border-dashed border-muted hover:border-international-orange/30 
  rounded-xl bg-muted/30 hover:bg-international-orange/5 
  transition-all duration-200 ease-out group">
  <div className="flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-full 
    bg-muted/50 group-hover:bg-international-orange transition-colors">
    <Plus className="w-4 h-4 text-muted-foreground group-hover:text-white" />
  </div>
  Add item...
</button>

// ❌ WRONG - Harsh dashed border
<button className="border-2 border-dashed border rounded-lg">
  + Add item
</button>
```

## Quick Reference

| Pattern | Key Classes |
|---|---|
| Card | `rounded-xl border shadow-sm` |
| Interactive Card | `transition-all duration-200 ease-out hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-muted-foreground/20` |
| Section Header | `border-b border-muted pb-3 flex items-center gap-3` |
| Accent Bar | `w-1 h-6 bg-{color} rounded-full` |
| Empty State | `bg-muted/30 rounded-xl py-12` |
| Toggle Active | `bg-international-orange/10 text-international-orange` |
| Row Hover | `hover:bg-muted/50 transition-colors duration-150` |
| Selection Ring | `ring-2 ring-international-orange/50 bg-international-orange/5` |
| Icon Container (small) | `p-1.5 rounded-lg bg-muted/50` |
| Icon Container (large) | `rounded-xl bg-{color}/10` |
| Skeleton Accent | `bg-{color}/30 rounded-full` |
| Quick Add Trigger | `rounded-xl bg-muted/30 hover:bg-international-orange/5` |
| Warning Section | `border-status-warning/30 bg-status-warning-light/30` |
| Single Avatar (role border) | `border-2 ${getRoleColors(role).border}` |

## Checklist Before Committing

- [ ] Cards use `rounded-xl border shadow-sm`
- [ ] Interactive elements have `duration-200 ease-out` transitions
- [ ] Section headers have accent bars matching content theme
- [ ] Empty states use soft `bg-muted/30` with large centered icons
- [ ] No harsh dashed borders (use soft dashed: `border-dashed border-muted`)
- [ ] Hover states use `/50` opacity backgrounds
- [ ] Selection states use brand colors (`ring-international-orange/50`)
- [ ] Loading skeletons match actual layout structure
- [ ] Toggle active states use brand-colored backgrounds
- [ ] Small icon containers use `p-1.5 rounded-lg bg-muted/50`
- [ ] Large icon containers use `rounded-xl bg-{color}/10`
- [ ] Chart cards have icon containers in headers
- [ ] Quick add triggers use inviting styling with hover transitions
